{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_07F280","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"今天Chico邀请我和士兵们一起钓鱼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":47,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"从自给食物的角度看也许有意义，但真希望别让我干这种无聊的活。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"就算他们说“钓鱼其实挺有意思”，我也很困扰。我可不是来这里玩的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不过，为了不让人发现我的真实身份，又不得不适当地陪他们一起，这才是麻烦的地方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"我拿着Chico硬塞给我的钓竿来到甲板，大约五名聚在那里的士兵高兴地欢迎了我。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Mother Base里男人占压倒多数，所以我简直被当成了公主。根本没人怀疑我既不是十几岁的少女，也不是学生。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":143,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"今天天气很好，风平浪静。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"抛出鱼线、等待鱼儿上钩时，士兵们一开始问了我各种问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我像往常一样，按照预先设定好的身份回答，再配上一脸客套的笑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"我随口敷衍着，鱼开始陆续上钩，士兵们也忙着应付自己的鱼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"Chico的鱼饵被鱼吃掉了。他气得站起来时差点掉进海里，大家都笑了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"那一刻，我也差点忍不住笑出声。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"过了一会儿，我的钓竿也有鱼上钩了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"刚感觉到轻轻一扯，下一瞬间鱼线便以惊人的力量被拉紧，我不由得惊叫了一声。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"看起来像是条相当大的鱼。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"因为是第一次钓鱼，我有些慌乱。旁边的士兵便从后面帮我托住钓竿。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"这片水面下面究竟生活着什么鱼呢？我稍稍想起了训练时潜入过的那片海。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"那时候的日子同样艰苦，可看着那些色彩斑斓的鱼优雅游动，我却会莫名感到平静。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"费了一番功夫钓上来的鱼，居然连<R=半瓦拉,40cm>都不到，多少有些扫兴。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=半瓦拉,40cm>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不过我又不是为了玩才钓鱼，所以根本没有不甘心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"Nuke一脸想要的样子在旁边转来转去，我就把钓到的鱼给了它。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"真可以说是糟透了的一天。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""}]}